                "text": "The Republicans' Big Ugly Bill will:\n\n1\u20e3 Kick 17 million Americans off their healthcare \n2\u20e3 Force rural hospitals to shut down \n3\u20e3 Take care away from seniors\n\nI'm voting NO on this legislation and will continue to fight to protect access to healthcare for all Americans. https://t.co/224P6p7xHW",
