                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I just got off the floor after voting NO against Republicans' Big Ugly Bill that will hurt all Americans. Millions will be kicked off healthcare, rural hospitals will shut down, and care will be taken away from seniors. I will continue to stand up for the needs of my constituents, not billionaires.",
