                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I recently spoke at the Alliance of Specialty Medicine\u2019s Advocacy Conference to talk with physicians about how Republican cuts to healthcare will harm hospitals, patients, and doctors. I will continue to fight to protect healthcare access for my constituents and everyday Americans.",
