                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I met with the Patient Quality of Life Coalition this week to talk about how important it is that patients and families can easily access high-quality palliative care, and discuss how to improve quality of care and life for adults and children who face life-threatening illnesses. https://t.co/OmXao8zuWd",
