                "text": "RFK Jr.'s decision to unilaterally replace the CDC committee that sets vaccine recommendations has put vaccine accessibility at risk for millions of Americans.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m leading a letter with @RepCasten calling on insurers to maintain vaccine coverage.\nhttps://t.co/ygWjpv1vnR",
