                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The countdown is on for huge price increases for health insurance following the passage of the Republicans' Big Ugly Bill.\n\nThat\u2019s right \u2013 their bill paves the way for the expiration of critical tax credits that Washingtonians rely on to purchase affordable health care coverage.\n\nIt is unacceptable, and I\u2019ll keep fighting to bring costs down before these premium hikes take effect at the end of this year.",
