                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I recently joined the team at Heritage Heights to celebrate the completion of their memory care unit and also to hear their concerns about how Medicaid cuts will hurt their patients.\n\nI was proud to secure federal funding for this project, and I will do all I can to continue to help seniors across the Eighth District.",
