                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I brought together patients, providers, and advocates at @harborviewmc to sound the alarm on how Republicans' Big Ugly Bill will cause health insurance costs to skyrocket for hundreds of thousands of Washingtonians. As a doctor, I know firsthand the impact that losing insurance will have on patients, and I\u2019ll continue fighting against this attack on our healthcare.",
