                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a pediatrician, I have relied on trusted experts at the CDC and FDA to inform my decisions while helping patients. RFK Jr. has put all of our health in jeopardy as he forces out officials at these agencies who refuse to comply with his conspiracy theory-based policies. We deserve better. We must conduct oversight now.",
