                "text": "The Open Enrollment period to select your 2026 health insurance starts in just a few weeks on November 1st.\n\nMillions of Americans will either see their premiums skyrocket or lose their health insurance altogether if Republicans don't extend critical tax credits now. I stand ready to work with my colleagues to protect the healthcare of my constituents and so many across the country.",
