                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On my tour of Mary Bridge Children's Hospital in Covington, I heard about how the devastating Medicaid cuts in Republicans' Big Ugly Bill will directly harm patients in our community.\n\nI will do everything in my power to reverse these cuts to make healthcare more affordable and accessible for all.",
