                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I had the opportunity to visit the @EvergreenHosp Primary Care Clinic in Sultan to hear about the essential services they provide and how cuts to Medicaid will harm patients. It is essential that we protect healthcare and the programs that many in #WA08 rely on. https://t.co/6o324WgLYx",
