                "text": "Jennifer from Carnation called my office to let me know that her premiums will increase next year from $239 to $1,170 a month for the same plan.\n\nThis is unacceptable and underscores why I am fighting to save vital healthcare tax credits that will lower costs. https://t.co/1M6v4xwgwt",
