                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today marks the start of open enrollment\u2014a time to renew or change your healthcare coverage.\n\nAt a time when costs are rising, I'll continue to fight for extending tax credits that help Washingtonians afford their healthcare coverage.\n\nFor more information about comparing plans, checking savings, and enrolling to get coverage, visit: https://t.co/Jyf8lLl9Cq",
