                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "With open enrollment beginning, folks across #WA08 are getting sticker shock from the high price of their premiums. Katja, a small business owner from Issaquah, reached out to let us know that her family\u2019s healthcare premiums for 2026 will nearly DOUBLE. That is plain unaffordable and unacceptable.\n\nThat's why I'm fighting to extend key tax credits that make health coverage more affordable.",
