                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "My constituents like Debra from Graham are worried they won\u2019t be able to afford healthcare. She recently called my office to say her premiums are going up by more than $1,000, and she might have to forgo coverage altogether until she qualifies for Medicare.\n\nAmericans deserve better. I will keep fighting tooth and nail for these tax credits that so many rely on to access care.",
